  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 760059cf5b1bb5149ae86fcc3aa6247e, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - "I'm strong enough to push down a whole tree, but every time soldiers show up,
    I just hide\u2026 I'm scared I'll turn into a monster."
  - You are right... I never saw myself that way. Thanks.
  - But my slime is sticky and gross. Everyone saw my slime run away. I hate it!
  - Really? Then I will try it on soldiers' axes!
  - The forest is so quiet. I just hear the wind and birds. Now hear axe noises.
    I can't sleep.
  - "Together? \u2026Okay. I trust you."
  - The ancient tree tell me I was strong. But I always felt I wasn't enough.
  - "Hmm\u2026 I'll go talk to them."
  - If I'd stood up sooner, would the forest be okay now?
  - "Yeah\u2026 starting today."
  typingSpeed: 0.03
  voiceSound: {fileID: 0}
  voicePitch: 1
  endDialogueLines: 
